# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Corsa
# Vauxhall Corsa D: launched in the UK in October 2006; production to 2014.
# UK registrations 72,584 (2006) to 101,828 (2008), consistently a UK top-three
# seller and the country's best-selling supermini for much of the run.
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Star Silver, Metro Blue, Technical Grey. These are
# the four largest DVSA shares for 2006-2014 registrations: black 20-23%,
# silver 21-30%, blue 17-23%, grey 13-15%. Paint names are Vauxhall marketing
# names for the approximate shades; the render values are approximations.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour. Weights total 55 against the Focus's 99.

